{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>HOY TV全新處境喜劇《你的保安李寶安》尚未正式開播已掀起全城話題！除了金像導演何爵天攜同李尚正、盧頌恩等班 …</p><p></p>\n<p>HOY TV全新處境喜劇《你的保安李寶安》尚未正式開播已掀起全城話題！除了金像導演何爵天攜同李尚正、盧頌恩等班底宣傳造勢外，劇中驚喜客串的日本知名AV女優濱崎真緒（浜崎真緒 / Mao Hamasaki）更成為全場焦點。日前，濱崎真緒親自在社交平台 Threads 發帖發起「親民攻勢」，憑藉一句「就不能光明正大在電視上看我一次嗎🥺」引爆全網共鳴，大批網民與粉絲紛紛湧入留言，場面既爆笑又溫馨。\n</p>\n<h3>網民直呼「駁唔到」 坦言以往要「鬼鬼祟祟」</h3>\n<p>濱崎真緒在 Threads 貼出這一句溫柔心聲：「就不能光明正大在電視上看我一次嗎🥺」，瞬間點燃網民熱議。由於以往影迷收看其成人作品時多數要隱密進行，這次難得能在免費電視台（HOY 77台）黃金時段合情合法地「正視」女神演出，不少網民大讚這句宣傳對白簡直是「大殺傷力武器」，紛紛留言：「You win 👍」、「駁唔到🫡」、「就是因為你才看🤣🤣」、「連我老婆都話要睇你！」。亦有死忠粉絲自豪回應：「平時都好光明正大用65吋電視機睇！」隨即獲濱崎真緒以簡短兩個字「很好」親自點讚。</p>\n<h2>女神親自回覆鼓勵粉絲拋開過去觀影包袱</h2>\n<p>帖文引發大量搞笑回應，有網民坦承過往觀看其作品時「習慣在廁所裏看」，濱崎真緒見狀隨即親自回覆鼓勵粉絲：「所以勇敢一點。8時在家開電視看👍🏼」。亦有粉絲笑問平時觀看是否需要鬼鬼祟祟，更有男網民爆料指連妻子也表示要觀看她演出，濱崎真緒大方送上吻臉貼圖進行親密互動。當有豪氣粉絲貼出客廳相片稱平時都光明正大用65寸電視機觀看時，她亦親自讚賞大表認同。\n</p>\n<h2>劇迷狂追問濱崎真緒於處境喜劇出場集數</h2>\n<p>該處境喜劇逢星期一至四晚上8時播出，並於星期五晚8時加推答問大會環節。劇集以屋苑管業處為背景，今次更特別邀請到跨國演員客串，令不少劇迷極度關心濱崎真緒究竟會在第一集還是後續劇情中正式登場。面對粉絲不斷留言追問出場時機，濱崎真緒展現出極高宣傳智慧與專業情商，幽默地向觀眾下達指令：「不要問。一直看❤️」，藉此呼籲大家持續死守電視機追看劇情發展。</p>\n<h2>粉絲被濱崎真緒真誠打動激發追劇熱潮</h2>\n<p>女神這番既幽默又帶點霸氣回應方式迅速在網絡上發酵，大批網民紛紛被其真誠態度與高超應答技巧所打動。留言區充斥著各種讚美與驚嘆，網民不斷寫下「駁唔到🫡」、「你贏 👍」以及「就是因為你才看🤣🤣」等熱烈反饋。這場由社交平台引爆討論熱潮讓劇集在開播階段便獲得極高關注度，大批觀眾已留言表示準備好每晚打開電視機準時收看。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309049324366020_16470209856ae063bd876ca.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-10-27 at 16.36.45.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309049324366020_16470209856ae063bd876ca.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309049448260713_728419876ae063bebe3a4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-10-27 at 16.36.42.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309049448260713_728419876ae063bebe3a4.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178524894711818368_13234999966a68bcb3784dd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"750085090_1799730371204428_3697535843871882510_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178524894711818368_13234999966a68bcb3784dd.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>日本AV女星濱崎真緒都有份！（圖片來源：濱崎真緒@Facebook）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17851654905167766_3694960386a6776b2e1e1d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17851654905167766_3694960386a6776b2e1e1d.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>自兩年前宣布從成人影視圈引退後，她成功轉型為DJ並積極拓展亞洲市場。（圖片來源：浜崎真緒@Facebook）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178426305301193475_20071268606a59b18d77340.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"濱崎真緒 前av女優 （圖片來源：FB@浜崎真緒）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178426305301193475_20071268606a59b18d77340.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：FB@浜崎真緒）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17842630548177197_18374820836a59b18f2db00.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"濱崎真緒 前av女優 （圖片來源：FB@浜崎真緒）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17842630548177197_18374820836a59b18f2db00.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：FB@浜崎真緒）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%bd%a0%e7%9a%84%e4%bf%9d%e5%ae%89%e6%9d%8e%e5%af%b6%e5%ae%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">你的保安李寶安</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%bf%b1%e5%b4%8e%e7%9c%9f%e7%b7%92/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">濱崎真緒</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%99%95%e5%a2%83%e5%96%9c%e5%8a%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">處境喜劇</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3531137\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 27 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:01:46.394497+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1539,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T08:41:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T10:58:47.604137+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:58:46.167648+00:00","content_hash":"d8085a64c759ec1ea957c3792e0803f3705d5db44873f57b7737bebe6142cc7a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}